\title{Formalising the Stack}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2026-08-18}
\meta{toc}{true}

\p{
    The reason the rest of this corpus is organised the way it is. The
    [verified zkEVM](https://verified-zkevm.org) effort runs three tracks — the zkVM constraints,
    the EVM semantics, and the cryptography — and [ArkLib](dhsorens-0040) and
    [CompPoly](dhsorens-0041) are the cryptography track.
}

\p{
    These pages stay closer to the code than the rest of the corpus, which also makes them the ones
    most likely to go stale. Related: [protocol snarkification](dhsorens-0020),
    [computable specifications](dhsorens-0025),
    [formal verification in proof assistants](dhsorens-0015), and
    [circuits and their specifications](dhsorens-002Y).
}

